      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "04 - SD1.5 inpainting masked edit for Mac Studio M2 Max 32GB.\nModel: models/checkpoints/sd-v1-5-inpainting.ckpt, symlinked from the existing CatVTON inpainting model. This is more reliable for masked edits than SDXL base on this server.\nInputs: input/body.jpg as the source image, input/inpaint_mask_clothing.png as a black/white mask. White areas are regenerated; black areas are preserved.\nDefault: resize both inputs to 768x1024, grow mask by 8 px, dpmpp_2m + karras, 22 steps, cfg 7.0, denoise 0.80.\nMeasured on this server: first SD1.5 inpainting test completed in about 49 seconds and produced output/sd15_inpaint_masked_edit_m2max_00001_.png.\nUse this for local edits: change clothing color/material, remove objects, repair hands, replace small background areas, or restyle a selected region.\nFor color/material edits, denoise 0.65-0.80 is usually enough. For object replacement/removal, try 0.80-0.92. If edges change too much, lower grow mask to 4."
      ],
      "color": "#243",
      "bgcolor": "#365"
    }
